//@version=6
// TAIL-C diag C, synthetic (not derived from any scraped script).
// Export on BINANCE:ETHUSDT.P 15, 2025-04-01 .. 2025-05-01 (lab tv --no-note, ws-report-v1).
// Replay it on the ETH 1m corpus feed, magnified: input_tf=1, script_tf=15, bar_magnifier on.
//
// Question: with use_bar_magnifier = true and calc_on_order_fills = true, a stop exit X fills
// mid-leg inside one of TradingView's 2-minute intrabars. When does TradingView make live the
// LIMIT entry R that X's recalculation places, and at what price does R fill?
// This is the magnified twin of lane W8D-NOTRADES's chart-path tapes
// (tests/fixtures/coof_refill_waypoint). The adapter lowers those only off the lower path, at
// src/source/pine_adapter.cpp:6776, gated `!coof_lower_path`.
//
// The script is stateless: every decision reads strategy.* only, so the recalculation's
// rollback cannot lose a decision.
// P: a 1-unit short every 2 hours on even UTC hours. X: its buy stop at the average + 3 USDT.
// P is closed after 8 bars.
// R is placed by the recalculation of X's fill, and re-placed by that bar's close while
// still flat. Two cells alternate by slot:
//   A (hour % 4 == 0): R = SELL limit at X's fill - 3 USDT. It is executable at X's fill
//     and, on the rising leg, at that leg's end (the 2m intrabar's high).
//     W8D rule on intrabars (DIAG-C LW8D): R fills AT the leg-end print (the 2m high).
//     Engine at 8988faff: R fills at its own level, X's fill - 3, on X's leg.
//   B (hour % 4 == 2): R = BUY limit at X's fill + 0.20 USDT. It is executable at X's fill,
//     but usually not at the rising leg's end.
//     W8D rule: R rests at its level from the leg end on. It fills later in the bar, or on
//     the next bar, at its level. Otherwise the next bar cancels it.
//     Engine at 8988faff: R fills at once at its level, on X's own leg.
// R is closed after 2 bars.
// Each R's entry bar and price tell the outcome: the leg-end print, or the level, bar-exact.
strategy("tailc-mag-coof-refill-leg", overlay = true, use_bar_magnifier = true,
     calc_on_order_fills = true, process_orders_on_close = false,
     default_qty_type = strategy.fixed, default_qty_value = 1, initial_capital = 10000000)

nC = strategy.closedtrades
lastExitHere = nC > 0 and strategy.closedtrades.exit_bar_index(nC - 1) == bar_index
lastExitWasX = nC > 0 and strategy.closedtrades.exit_id(nC - 1) == "X"
flat = strategy.position_size == 0
openId = strategy.opentrades > 0 ? strategy.opentrades.entry_id(0) : ""
heldBars = strategy.opentrades > 0 ? bar_index - strategy.opentrades.entry_bar_index(0) : 0
xBar = nC > 0 ? strategy.closedtrades.exit_time(nC - 1) : na
cellA = hour(nz(xBar, time), "UTC") % 4 < 2

if flat and not lastExitHere and minute(time) == 0 and hour(time, "UTC") % 2 == 0
    strategy.entry("P", strategy.short)
if openId == "P"
    strategy.exit("X", "P", stop = strategy.position_avg_price + 3)
    if heldBars >= 8
        strategy.close("P")
if flat and lastExitHere and lastExitWasX
    xPrice = strategy.closedtrades.exit_price(nC - 1)
    if cellA
        strategy.entry("RA", strategy.short, limit = xPrice - 3)
    else
        strategy.entry("RB", strategy.long, limit = xPrice + 0.2)
if flat and not lastExitHere
    strategy.cancel("RA")
    strategy.cancel("RB")
if (openId == "RA" or openId == "RB") and heldBars >= 2
    strategy.close_all(comment = "R done")
